      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STRAIGHT TO THETOP (5) finished seventh last start over 1690m at Kilmore, beaten 8 metres, after filling a minor placing there at the previous appearance over 2180m. With some luck from a tricky gate, he can take this out. MAJESTIC CHARMA (6) produced a better effort at her latest appearance, scoring by a neck over 2080m at Cranbourne after travelling at the rear of the field. Stepping up a level this time but she is good enough to take this out. KENNYS SON (2) was out of the money two starts ago then things went wrong last start when he broke and finished a distant eighth over 2230m at Globe Derby Park. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Can't make any mistakes against this field but he is right in the mix. JILLIBY TOPGUN (4) is in the mix if he can recapture the form from two starts back that saw him score over 1690m at this track. Stick with him.",
